  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market development for agriculture export - Market development for Agriculture</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Marknadsutveckling f&#xf6;r jordbruksexport</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Sida avser finansiera en konsultstudie som tillhandah&#xe5;ller marknadsinformation och kontakter till potentiella k&#xf6;pare av Rwandiska jordbruksprodukter. Insatsen bidrar till Rwandas exportfr&#xe4;mjande och st&#xf6;djer utvecklandet av v&#xe4;rdekedjor f&#xf6;r jordbruksprodukter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy of Sweden will contract a consultant to explore market potential for Rwandan agricultural exportsers in Sweden. The consultancy supports an initiative by the Rwandan Development Board (RDB), National Agricultural Export Development Board (NAEB), and the Rwandan Embassy in Stockholm to organize a Mini-Expo to promote new trade opportunities between Sweden and Rwanda.</narrative>
  </description>
